                %a{:href => "http://www.tac.mta.ca/tac/volumes/28/13/28-13abs.html"}> tac:28-13
                \&amp;rbrack;
          %p See also:
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                nCafé blog 2012:
                %em
                  %a{:href => "https://golem.ph.utexas.edu/category/2012/09/where_do_monads_come_from.html"} Where do Monads come from?
            %li
