                = succeed ":" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Tim+Campion"} Tim Campion
                %em
                  %a{:href => "https://mathoverflow.net/questions/220246/what-is-the-point-of-pointwise-kan-extensions"} What is the point of pointwise Kan extensions?
          %p Codensity monads arising from subcategory inclusions are studied in
          %ul
            %li#diLiberti19
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ivan+Di+Liberti"}> Ivan Di Liberti
              ,
