                %em Shape Theory: Categorical Methods of Approximation
                , (1989), Mathematics and its Applications, Ellis Horwood. Reprinted Dover (2008).
          %p The dual concept of a “model-induced cotriple”:
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Harry+Applegate"}> Harry Applegate
