          %p
            For a description of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Giry+monad"} Giry monad
            and other
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/probability+monads"} probability monads
            as codensity monads, see
          %ul
            %li#Avery14
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Tom+Avery"}> Tom Avery
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Codensity and the Giry monad
                %strong 220
